window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Willa</p> <p>I’ve been in love with him for years, despite knowing he could never be mine.</p> <p>Now his charming new boyfriend is determined to include me in all their plans.</p> <p>Zander</p> <p>I’ve been infatuated with him for years, despite us being in different states. Now we’re living in the same city with the only woman who’s come close to holding my heart.</p> <p>Damian</p> <p>I’ve been intrigued by her for years, despite us never knowing each other.</p> <p>Now I just need to convince the two people I care most about that three is better than two. Flurry is an MMF Hockey Romance</p>"; 
